  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Woman Leadership in the ICT public Sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;the &lt;strong&gt;overall objective&lt;/strong&gt; of this Action is to &lt;strong&gt;enhance digital capacity and strengthen digital citizenship for girls and women, in all their diversity. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;To achieve this overall objective, the Action will work on three specific objectives (SOs): &lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SO 1&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;strong&gt;&#xbf;&lt;/strong&gt;Capacities of public sector leaders to develop inclusive digital transformation policies applying a gender perspective are increased.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SO 2&lt;/strong&gt;: Opportunities for women and girls from young generation to access STEM education are increased.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SO 3&lt;/strong&gt;: Awareness, prevention and support mechanisms related to gender-based cyberviolence including mechanism for women victims of cyberviolence are improved.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
